    "detailed_description": "Reclaiming what's rightfully yours among the stars! Prepare to journey through a starry filled castle in <strong>Starstream</strong>, where the quest to reclaim your castle from the treacherous <strong>Lord Nova</strong> awaits. Gather your weapons, master the powerful and versatile <strong><i>Starshift</i></strong>, and embark on an epic adventure to restore order to the realm. The stars align for your triumphant return!",
    "about_the_game": "Reclaiming what's rightfully yours among the stars! Prepare to journey through a starry filled castle in <strong>Starstream</strong>, where the quest to reclaim your castle from the treacherous <strong>Lord Nova</strong> awaits. Gather your weapons, master the powerful and versatile <strong><i>Starshift</i></strong>, and embark on an epic adventure to restore order to the realm. The stars align for your triumphant return!",
    "short_description": "Starstream is a 3D action-adventure shooter. In it, the brave Arlen must reclaim Castle Starstream, seized by the corrupt Lord Nova. Arlen battles through the Keep, Great Halls, and Startower to confront Lord Nova and free the Castle.",
